{"id":"n73063-1-17","stage":1,"title":"안쪽 · 里边","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73063-1-17-1","ko":"여기 다른 사이즈의 옷도 있나요?","zh":"这里还有其他尺码的衣服吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"사이즈의","meaning":"尺寸，号，尺码","explanation":"사이즈：尺寸，号，尺码；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사이즈","audio":"/audio/e0511ad24076321c499a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61226","senseId":"1","lemma":"사이즈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이즈의","audio":"/audio/bca95674244747ef1672.mp3"}},{"text":"옷도","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷도","audio":"/audio/5e808ffa84819df467ec.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":